# Bind-mounted at runtime by docker-compose.app.yml's db-restore/media-restore — never needed
# baked into any image layer, and the tools/builder stages otherwise COPY it in wholesale
# (Dockerfile's `COPY . .`), which would put the committed dump/media mirror inside a layer with
# no reason to carry it.
